==== (3) the local Frobenius sigma_N ====
Q(b), b^3=b+1: global Frobenius automorphism does not exist; sigma_N (prec 12) = tau, sigma_N^3 = id on 9 elements: true
Q(zeta_7)^+: global Frobenius automorphism exists; sigma_N (prec 12) = tau, sigma_N^3 = id, sigma_N = sigma on 9 elements: true

